{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a highly trained special agent\u2026 who also happens to be a very good boy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced stealth-action platformer you\u2019ll combine stealth, barkour (dog-parkour), and gadgets to complete your missions. Use these tools to explore vast, stunning locations with numerous secrets to discover.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak through shadows, enter all guns blazing or bounce off rooftops - <strong>BARKOUR</strong> gives you the freedom to play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGENT T.H.U.N.D.E.R.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just saving the day - you're doing it with style, snark, and a tail that won\u2019t stop wagging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Agent T.H.U.N.D.E.R. - the world\u2019s most agile canine secret agent. Smart(ish), loyal, and absolutely unstoppable when equipped with high-tech gadgets and a bone to pick with evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his grumpy-but-helpful AI sidekick A.L.F.-RED, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. confidently tackles missions his way: stealthy and slick or loud and proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/848e46c169771078f05bd8b7a3a4374c.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/848e46c169771078f05bd8b7a3a4374c.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/848e46c169771078f05bd8b7a3a4374c.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Bark Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend stealth, speed and barkour to outsmart villains and complete missions your way. Each offers multiple approaches, so you're free to improvise\u2026 or just cause chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dog with Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, slide, bounce and bark your way through beautiful and diverse levels full of verticality, secrets and challenges. It\u2019s all about rhythm, agility, and that perfect landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the Gadgets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From smoke grenades to jetpacks, swap out gear on the fly and upgrade your loadout with tools that are as stylish as they are effective. Looking cool is part of the mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniff Out Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, stunning environments - from high-tech laboratories to shady amusement parks. You\u2019ll find hidden paths, bonus challenges and Easter eggs around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/910a7a58657b24c0e5d79b54fdcd042d.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/910a7a58657b24c0e5d79b54fdcd042d.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/910a7a58657b24c0e5d79b54fdcd042d.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO SCOPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the tutorial and part of the game\u2019s first location \u2013 the Gothic Castle. The expected playtime is around 45\u201360 minutes, compared to the full version which offers at least 12\u201315 hours of gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you focus on stealth, exploration, and finding collectibles, the longer your playthrough will take. The more you try to speedrun and look for shortcuts, the closer you\u2019ll get to the lower end of the estimate. Every map in the full version supports both playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, only a few selected gadgets are available, while the full game will feature over 30 of them. In the demo, players will face a single enemy type, whereas the full version will introduce several enemy varieties in each location as well as boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo offers a taste of the core mechanics - stealth, combat, and dog parkour - but the full version expands them on a much larger scale and strongly supports replayability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075040?t=1760093601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/767f66c81888804634aac7f7db916a340c89266b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760093601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/8adf48176f0427a12e06c7a52ea893e18272a7d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760093601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/8adf48176f0427a12e06c7a52ea893e18272a7d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760093601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/41a59f4cccc552f2d9385e830190ad09.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a highly trained special agent\u2026 who also happens to be a very good boy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced stealth-action platformer you\u2019ll combine stealth, barkour (dog-parkour), and gadgets to complete your missions. Use these tools to explore vast, stunning locations with numerous secrets to discover.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak through shadows, enter all guns blazing or bounce off rooftops - <strong>BARKOUR</strong> gives you the freedom to play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.poster.avif?t=1760093601\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/b147b1c6b16d5c1e24e9d0cfabcfef61.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGENT T.H.U.N.D.E.R.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just saving the day - you're doing it with style, snark, and a tail that won\u2019t stop wagging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Agent T.H.U.N.D.E.R. - the world\u2019s most agile canine secret agent. Smart(ish), loyal, and absolutely unstoppable when equipped with high-tech gadgets and a bone to pick with evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his grumpy-but-helpful AI sidekick A.L.F.-RED, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. confidently tackles missions his way: stealthy and slick or loud and proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/848e46c169771078f05bd8b7a3a4374c.poster.avi