.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/910a7a58657b24c0e5d79b54fdcd042d.webm?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/extras/910a7a58657b24c0e5d79b54fdcd042d.mp4?t=1760093601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO SCOPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo includes the tutorial and part of the game\u2019s first location \u2013 the Gothic Castle. The expected playtime is around 45\u201360 minutes, compared to the full version which offers at least 12\u201315 hours of gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you focus on stealth, exploration, and finding collectibles, the longer your playthrough will take. The more you try to speedrun and look for shortcuts, the closer you\u2019ll get to the lower end of the estimate. Every map in the full version supports both playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, only a few selected gadgets are available, while the full game will feature over 30 of them. In the demo, players will face a single enemy type, whereas the full version will introduce several enemy varieties in each location as well as boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo offers a taste of the core mechanics - stealth, combat, and dog parkour - but the full version expands them on a much larger scale and strongly supports replayability.</p>","developers":["VARSAV Game Studios S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"1920290","name":"Barkour"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075040/1aa0e281b49646fdd68ede771df64686de961f7d/header.jpg?t=1760093601","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla